tyle=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">개인별 문자통보</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; * <u>국가근로신청자 중 서약서 제출자만 문자통보.</u></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 서약서 제출관련 공지(2013-1학기 국가근로신청안내 공지사항) 참조</span></p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; * 국가근로신청 후 서약서 미제출자 중 근로를 원하는 학생은 희망근로지를 선택 후</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 서약서를 2.19(화)까지 학생처(본관101호)로 가져오시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; [<u>서약서 출력방법 </u>: 한국장학재단 로그인 - 마이페이지 - 장학금신청현황</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 국가근로장학금 선택 후 신청서 인쇄]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; * 국가근로장학생 우선선발자 : 1순위〉2순위〉3순위</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 국가근로장학생 선발절차</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;가. (학생) 희망근로지 신청[2. 15(금)~18(월)12:00까지]</span></p></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; * <font color=\"#ff007f\">신청방법</font> : 한국장학재단 홈페이지 로그인 → 사이버창구 → 장학금관리</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;→ 근로장학관리→ 희망 근로기관 신청현황 → 원하는 근로기관 신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; * 희망부서에 따로 전화하지 않고 희망근로지만 선택하면 됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; * 순위통과자만 희망근로지 선택가능</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;나. (각 해당부서) 각 부서에서 희망근로지를 신청한 학생명단을 확인 후 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학생에게 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">연락[2.20(수)~22(금)]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;다. (학생) 선발된 학생은 <u>온라인신청</u>(각 해당부서에는 연락받은 학생)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">[2.25(월)~27(수)]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;* </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">온라인신청</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">원스톱서비스 로그인 - 학생지원 - ‘근로장학생 신청서 제출’에서 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 희망근무부서 선택 - 신청 클릭 - 완료[별도서류 제출 없음]</span></p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;라. (학생처) 근로장학생 선발확정 : 2013. 2. 28(목)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;3. 근로기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 3. 4(월) ~ 6. 23(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;4. 근로장학금액</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- 교내일반 : 시간당 급여 6,000원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- 전공산업체 : 시간당 급여 8,000원</span